# Lifeblood speech: brawls. The format and every fact and word are described in basics.speech.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Brawls: fistfights nobody dies in. [listener] is the other brawler (or, for brawl_watch, a friend in the fight).

== brawl_challenge ==
[taught_angry]! That's it, [listener]. Fists up. {w=3}
That's it. You and me, right now.
I've had it with you, [listener]. Put 'em up.
Come on then, [listener]! Fists!
You want to settle this? Let's settle this.
Outside. Now. Oh wait, we're already outside. {lighthearted, w=2}
Put 'em up, you son of a slime! {crude, w=3}
I've been waiting a long time for this. {vengeful, w=3}
I'm going to wipe that look off your face. {hothead, w=3}
Let's see who's better. For real this time. {competitive, w=3}
You. Me. No weapons. Let's go. {proper, w=2}
I don't like you, [listener]. Never have. {honest, w=2}

== brawl_accept ==
What was that for?! I never did anything to you! {unprovoked=yes, w=4}
Out of nowhere? Really? Fine, then! {unprovoked=yes, w=3}
I thought we were fine, [listener]. Guess not. {unprovoked=yes, opinion=friendly, w=4}
You'll remember this. I certainly will. {unprovoked=yes, vengeful, w=5}
What the hell, [listener]?! {unprovoked=yes, crude, w=4}
I... What did I do? {unprovoked=yes, timid, w=4}
How dare you. Unprovoked! {unprovoked=yes, proper, w=4}
[taught_angry]! You're going to regret that! {w=4}
Oh, it's like that? Fine!
You want a fight? You've got one!
Big mistake, [listener].
Did you just hit me?!
Ow! Right, that's it!
You'll regret that.          {vengeful, w=2}
Hey! I don't want to fight! ...Fine! {timid, w=3}
Ha! Finally, some excitement! {brave, lighthearted, w=3}
Oh, you're going to pay for that, you little... {crude, w=3}
I'll make you sorry for that. {hothead, w=3}
Very well. If you insist.    {proper, w=3}
Was that a punch? Felt like a breeze. {proud, w=3}

== brawl_yield ==
Okay! Okay! I give up!
Enough! You win!
Stop! I yield!
Fine, fine. You win.
Ow... all right, you win, [listener].
I yield! Please, no more!    {timid, w=3}
You got lucky. That's all.   {proud, w=4}
This isn't over.             {vengeful, w=3}
Rematch. Tomorrow. I mean it. {competitive, w=4}
Good fight, [listener]. You earned it. {forgiving, w=3}
Damn it... you win.          {crude, w=3}
Ha... ow. Well, I had fun.   {lighthearted, w=3}
Cube God, I'm sore.          {pious, w=2}

== brawl_win ==
And stay down!
Ha! Had enough?
That settles that.
Now we're even.
Good fight.
Next time, think twice.      {brave, w=2}
That's what you get!         {hothead, w=3}
Never doubt me.              {proud, w=3}
Ha! Another one for me.      {competitive, w=3}
No hard feelings, [listener]. {forgiving, w=3}
Sorry. Got a bit carried away. {polite, w=3}
I feel so much better now.   {hothead, w=2}
Thank the Cube God that's over. {pious, w=2}
Running away? Coward!        {forfeit=yes, w=8}
That's right, walk away.     {forfeit=yes, w=8}
Ha! Didn't think you had the guts. {forfeit=yes, rude, w=8}

== brawl_escalate ==
A weapon?! In a fistfight?!
Oh, so that's how it is!
You brought a weapon to a fistfight! You're dead!
Cheater!                     {competitive, w=3}
Now it's serious.            {serious, w=3}
Coward! Fight fair!          {proud, w=3}
You bastard!                 {crude, w=3}

== brawl_watch ==
Fight! Fight! Fight!         {extrovert, w=3}
Ooh, [brawler] and [other_brawler] are at it again.
Somebody stop them!          {timid, w=3}
Stop it, both of you!        {polite, w=2}
Ten on [brawler]!            {greedy, w=3}
Ten on [other_brawler]!      {greedy, w=3}
Ha! Get 'em!                 {lighthearted, w=2}
Grown adults, fighting in the street. {serious, w=2}
Violence never solved anything. {forgiving, w=2}
Hit 'em harder, [listener]!  {friend_fighting=yes, brave, w=4}
Be careful, [listener]!      {friend_fighting=yes, w=4}
Leave [listener] alone!      {friend_fighting=yes, hothead, w=4}
Oh, I'm telling everyone about this. {nosy, w=4}
Cube God, give them sense.   {pious, w=2}
...                          {introvert}
